    "description": "Practice observed vs expected counts, chi-square contributions, simulation-based interpretation, hypotheses, conditions, test statistic calculation, p-value decisions, largest contribution analysis, expected counts in two-way tables, and setting up homogeneity/independence tests for Topics 8.1-8.5."
  },

